  "project_description": "This module provides a \" Plugin reference \" field that allows to create soft references to plugins.\n\n This module was created to allow to create relationships between entities and plugins in a simple way. The aim of these relationships is usually to perform background actions against the entity using the selected plugin.\n\n Usage \n This module provides a new field type that can reference a plugin.\n\n Usage is straightforward. You only need to create a new field of type \" Plugin reference \" for your entity and configure it in the same way you do for other field types.",
